# Play test of Stilt Hollow (CIPlay stilt_hollow, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe.
island Stilt Hollow
expect step 0
expect title Water for Stilt Hollow

# Up the ladder from the reef onto the landing stack: hyenas burst out of the dock trailer
climb 7.5 -16.9 h=0.3
zone town
expect step 0
expect message Hyenas burst out
kill Hyena
expect animals Hyena 0
expect step 1

# Up the walkway to the pump stack: the notice, the dead pump, the gate shut
walk 9.5 -12.5 to 15.5 -0.8 h=7.1
read Water warden's notice
expect step 2
use pump
expect message valve wheel is missing
walk 15 1.2 to 9 1.8 blocked

# Down the red pipe to the divers' box at the air pocket
openat 26.5 3.6
expect story valve 1
expect step 3

# The pump runs, the gate opens: up the ramp to the mayor's rock
use pump
expect message pump coughs
expect story valve 0
expect shown pumpsound
wait 3
walk 15 1.2 to 1 2.4 h=9.8
zone mayor
expect step 4
expect message white screecher
kill Screecher
expect step 5
open Mayor's chest
expect item Hat_Mayor 1
expect done
